{"id":"u-d95ca01e-2a35-4dc7-9207-f047de769717","src":"community","title":"Squat Max and Upper Hypertrophy","author":"Daniël","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/fkxddj-daniel-zomer-1","desc":"This 9‑week program is designed to build upper‑body strength and hypertrophy while preparing you to hit a new squat max in week 9.\n\nWeeks 1 through 4 focus on establishing a solid foundation of strength and training volume. \n\nWeek 5 serves as a deload to reduce accumulated fatigue. \n\nWeeks 6 through 8 taper the workload so you can maintain strength while recovering fully, setting you up for a strong performance in week 9.\n\nMost of the program is based on RPE and rep ranges, while the squat follows fixed percentages of your initial 1RM. It’s important to stick to the prescribed RPE—even if that means performing fewer reps within the range, or fewer than you managed the previous week. The goal is to train with the intended stimulus, not to chase numbers.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-05-17T10:30:41.758Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":80},{"r":8,"pct":69,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Alternating Dumbbell Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Raise","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Extented Lateral Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"